---
import ProsePage from '../layouts/ProsePage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
---

<ProsePage
  title="Advertising"
  kicker="Commercial"
  description={`Advertising, sponsorship, and labelling standards at ${site.name}.`}
  lede="What we sell, how it is labelled, and where the line sits between commercial and editorial."
>
  <h2>Inventory</h2>
  <p>
    Pages carry display advertising at standard IAB sizes: leaderboard (728×90), MPU (300×250),
    half-page (300×600), billboard (970×250), and an in-article unit. Every slot is labelled and
    carries a <code>data-ad-slot</code> attribute for integration and measurement.
  </p>

  <h2>Labelling</h2>
  <p>
    Display advertising is visually separated from editorial content and marked as advertising.
    Sponsored articles, where they run, carry a label at the top of the page and in any listing where
    they appear, and they name the sponsor. We do not run commercial material that is designed to be
    mistaken for reporting.
  </p>

  <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
  <p>
    Buying advertising does not buy coverage, and it does not buy protection from coverage. Our
    <a href={withBase('editorial-policy')}>editorial policy</a> sets out the separation in full.
  </p>

  <h2>What we do not accept</h2>
  <p>
    We decline advertising that is deceptive, that targets children, that promotes weapons or
    surveillance products aimed at private individuals, or that cannot be clearly attributed to an
    identifiable advertiser.
  </p>

  <h2>Reader data</h2>
  <p>
    The advertising units on this site are placeholder creatives rendered directly in the page. They
    are not served by an ad server, they are not personalised, and they set no cookies. If that
    changes, our <a href={withBase('privacy')}>privacy policy</a> will be updated before it goes
    live and consent controls will be added where required.
  </p>

  <h2>Enquiries</h2>
  <p>
    Rates, availability, and partnerships:
    <a href="mailto:advertising@theharborledger.com">advertising@theharborledger.com</a>. General
    newsroom contact is <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</ProsePage>
